NAME
     free - how much memory is used

SYNOPSIS
     free [-h] [-k] [-m]

DESCRIPTION
     free prints total, used and free memory, and how much of it is the
     block cache -- which is memory the kernel will give back rather than
     memory that is gone.

OPTIONS
     -h   kilobytes and megabytes
     -k   kilobytes
     -m   megabytes

SEE ALSO
     vmstat(1), top(1), freepg(1)
